      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The plunderer orders an ally to attack or to get in position. Until the end of the ally's next turn, they gain the plunderer's choice of a +2 status bonus to attack rolls or a +10-foot status bonus to their Speeds.</p>\n<p>Effect: Bosun's Command</p>",
